{"id":"wb-7-1013","name":"鸡鸣山民居苑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"鸡鸣山民居苑","text":"鸡鸣山民居苑又称龙游民居苑，位于浙江省衢州市龙游县龙游镇南郊鸡鸣山，占地6.6万平方米。从1991年起，鸡鸣山民居苑将龙游地区部分缺乏就地保护条件的明、清古建筑集中迁建。除位于原址的鸡鸣塔外，现有迁入古建筑“高岗起凤”、“翊秀亭”、“巫氏厅”、“汪氏民居”、“邵氏小厅”、“灵山花厅”等六座。1997年8月29日列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。现为4A级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%B8%A1%E9%B8%A3%E5%B1%B1%E6%B0%91%E5%B1%85%E8%8B%91","revisionId":93085122,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93085122","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/500b6ac38665a3deb702858c.jpg","title":"Longyou_Jimingshan_Minjuyuan_2016.12.10_15-22-54.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Longyou_Jimingshan_Minjuyuan_2016.12.10_15-22-54.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/Longyou_Jimingshan_Minjuyuan_2016.12.10_15-22-54.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"鸡鸣山民居苑\n\n高冈起凤","width":320,"height":213}}